  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1413e6aa84787dd74040b3db",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其实，在小学的新闻部里\n曾同时连载着5部漫画。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5441ea06a07a289f6f8a3ca1dbc96dcbde5f65a5bd11ff108a983fa25954998",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "69",
        "9284"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f131fe96f201838e3e20a569",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其实，不论什么样的枕头都能睡着。",
      "source_fingerprint": "611b2defbd954358f478dc280e61b918c653a00e2f5f5bf795ce9c1ed70a4e0b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "69",
        "9285"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c8b7f6d6834625b702e2546",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其实，小时候曾被姐姐们\n当成换装娃娃玩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "39c22ad2fde0c9afa7f2ad81cc8f7c47ffa6b70c77fe895330f265c868a354f3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "69",
        "9286"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09095744d5f0fa206510c809",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其实，最擅长的画材是丙烯颜料。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b957a358bfce1bfc5f65b4c5da185ca02a2a65cd1c4f17747396f25efa3540b3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "69",
        "9287"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd8c26960ca3884c04413aa0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其实，喜欢的食物是酥脆的\n国王饼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d60eb45beff3cdc3c54889ab1da211ce0e8e5b0529f2ef26ef2d827e1e3e76bd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "69",
        "9288"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86d61db0627f4dbcdede0009",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其实，有3条正在悉心养护的牛仔裤。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f82531723778dafc03c4234f5d4c2ec6f1686f5786a0448ed6a7a1b87b9af108",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "69",
        "9289"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ea916766cad7544e9273c29",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其实，套圈圈的技术百发百中。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0dd831dc4d54a5229cd2f5d91e6b62ee30435dfee667cba16e7256f5a1d9142",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "69",
        "9290"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e6a6aa48b2eb36377110c10",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其实，小时候曾见过妖精。",
      "source_fingerprint": "48b20839e3a4b0eda770fa8959f3dd0c028edcfedfb9d91483b554046f06365b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "69",
        "9291"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55abda3db182b45133942d9f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其实，在意大利有一家\n常去的裁缝店。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef412b67c25d8f605d66a5f29f9b956144c2b14567824d439c462d398df9eaa9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "69",
        "9292"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58075adaea2c4046966b03cf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其实，每周会去一次\n草裙舞教室。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c57c20295790bf21e38e0cb773c182037b319f159cd9ec5eb2f0581024a9dd61",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "69",
        "9293"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69e1c6406d08c4e2d787d6b1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其实，从几个月前开始就在期待\n年末的搞笑大奖赛了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "863cc6615a0f77bba12901809d0fbc290ee4e850f9f4bd698725e6eb6fcb9633",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "69",
        "9294"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49b4db3c5eac1294f3cbe38d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其实，偶尔会盯着水族箱\n发呆。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1eebfb8cfccd1c8b39f998e1d0d6d2f43c8330d36e0f159b556f043e4ac48ff7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "69",
        "9295"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7c5ae96bc2e6ba262ce16f4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其实，从未设过闹钟。",
      "source_fingerprint": "66dd0e96086d11387de3fa353b19275688a546de1657d280733bd77a5eb26071",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "69",
        "9296"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5582ee60568e052ebf04f175",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其实，弓道水平高超到\\n能够射落飘落的树叶。",
      "source_fingerprint": "85db4f2c2f024126e560152f29bf3e8df701c7a443522cdc680d4a93345436c3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "69",
        "9297"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73b721cb572bfc8ffbf48dfb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其实，想了解近况的话\\n去看姐姐的Umasta会更快。",
      "source_fingerprint": "37b07e16f42df13b9ffa91074a08dd9b9b02cdf3ea8cdc21f94975c8feb12105",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "69",
        "9298"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e9dd406b0fe7e31419bd19f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其实，起名品味宛如武士一般。",
      "source_fingerprint": "99fd86f87fb44ac538c4adfbe3e31fbc354d4b304f5a3936fc3b583ac6981367",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "69",
        "9299"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e72ae3155830bc2246723425",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "二人世界",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1bd8e1aa4ceed7cb8a6ce1628a6166d189b5dc650f3e69041113003f75955e8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "69",
        "93"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2be022d1def5e39ddd4ca0e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其实，每天都会尽可能把鞋子打理得干干净净。",
      "source_fingerprint": "389f972be4a9bc9ba21ae93b81488986ce4864d4837790570c98b272bb67cd65",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "69",
        "9300"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:483bc6ceb31f4050d0748a43",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其实，在玩游戏时\\n一定会给主角起和自己相同的名字。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e9a123478c60b232dd6c5d9a8f6ac38118b6a839b7698f881ed7b785245d631",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "69",
        "9301"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:026f539770b1666891c56316",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其实，把自己拥有的所有教科书\\n都画满了翻页小漫画。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e723a34510d151badba9a3e1005159d6871fcc47b0d343c10c8d9a00ba3a8f1a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "69",
        "9302"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a3d636072e5a42a610f80f9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其实，弱点是经常被检票闸机卡住。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91542c64c4fc865b2e515c35645b284f08e2d8f0c8fcfaa9cbe43c77430004c3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "69",
        "9303"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d2c995bf67e4301932d1e1c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其实，备用手偶的眼神略显锐利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "51a59b1460528bf2988f3e5f6e246d1d30593a4513ce4277527f5905da373e76",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "69",
        "9304"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88fa9c41ec8f0df13ab2a8f1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其实，绝对不会泄露他人的秘密。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d38f409922dc48317201a2f05e744ff350beda509e3f9dd2f5b16dc21de7c4b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "69",
        "9305"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2be0f3bad912c3325da5e522",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其实，经常跟不上\\n关于胡萝卜的话题讨论。",
      "source_fingerprint": "172b35a96e1bcd619ba23e04f6ebcf2ba493830a454f7b14aa856a1a86743366",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "69",
        "9306"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5c17bd356a2643afb067ab1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其实，据说在赛车游戏中所展现的\\n车技相当惊人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "927b72505e7b7229646dc1f884094547859396abaa44064e67d917ce083f8990",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "69",
        "9307"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:050a0b41445e43bfa52b2612",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其实，老家的甜点师\\n会定期寄来香草饼干。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e16a27a04248d005340b524f0b499432ba1d80dd32a4f55035511deaf904a7f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "69",
        "9308"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed9313fbc1fbf2c3a65a5723",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其实，是根据门童的素质来挑选酒店的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "df57bd8381310fbca22af90a0d5688befa9aabb8033715c304386132adc00eb5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "69",
        "9309"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93497bca6acd17704b236da6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其实，阅读报纸上的连载小说\\n是每天不为人知的小乐趣。",
      "source_fingerprint": "94999f6b26e389c6c2acc3fcf8bdb466c682abd21732c619da81fb11c04f1b49",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "69",
        "9310"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62fc4273f7af6d8af29e91c2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其实，把学生时代在粉丝感谢祭上制作的\\n团队T恤当作家居服来穿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3307a5c0ad0917c818151f8267a92eaef774bc54682ab37ebe8487330cec8d91",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "69",
        "9311"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:035200c215cf96b65d02963a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "作・绘：米浴",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bc78f01ac403def09f69918311af5f3fd46577eaadb91f8abd6561a94243fa6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "69",
        "94"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f894d71abc56e4f5c7c11ee2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "好想见到",
      "source_fingerprint": "882d04300c57bfa69fae5ab586fd3f6a81fdd5aced158dc00edb48af0b245104",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "69",
        "95"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fae5756c784901cb0edb4d65",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "相扑流料理法",
      "source_fingerprint": "164e9d57ad9b856a9f8b9cc567c02db3ce9f3be270749a3f2faacfab4723a11b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "69",
        "96"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1b8f41f191dcd234278b4b9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Lucky Advice？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f7bed21a8012bd6c7049b8686816115a05a44a8a489090f435de7ffc582055f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "69",
        "97"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15d822aaef5bb8e2c5677613",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "寒冷是大敌！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3380184839495a38743178d92426f12711d8fb872ea4ee6fb5cf42b042dc3fd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "69",
